WEBVTT

00:09.068 --> 00:10.344
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.413 --> 00:12.137
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.206 --> 00:13.620
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.689 --> 00:15.724
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.793 --> 00:18.655
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.724 --> 00:20.724
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.793 --> 00:22.793
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.862 --> 00:24.379
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.448 --> 00:26.517
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:26.586 --> 00:28.758
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.827 --> 00:30.827
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:30.896 --> 00:32.758
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.724
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.793 --> 00:36.586
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:36.655 --> 00:38.862
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.931 --> 00:40.724
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.793 --> 00:42.137
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.206 --> 00:44.068
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:44.137 --> 00:46.344
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.413 --> 00:48.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:48.965 --> 00:50.827
[waves crash,
birds cooing]
[海浪拍打，
鸟儿咕咕叫]

00:50.896 --> 00:54.586
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:54.655 --> 01:01.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.413 --> 01:06.000
[clams cooing]
[蛤蜊咕咕叫]

01:06.068 --> 01:09.275
- [rhythmic yelling]
- [有节奏的喊叫]

01:12.172 --> 01:13.172
Hey, Timmy.
嘿，蒂米。

01:13.241 --> 01:16.517
I found your ball
and your sister.
我找到了你的球
还有你的妹妹。

01:16.586 --> 01:17.724
- Hi!
- 你好！

01:18.793 --> 01:19.758
- Yep.
- 是的。

01:19.827 --> 01:22.344
[rhythmic yell]
- Whee!
[有节奏的喊叫]
- 呼！

01:22.413 --> 01:25.275
both: [giggle]
Yeah!
两人：[咯咯笑]
是啊！

01:25.344 --> 01:26.793
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:26.862 --> 01:28.068
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

01:28.137 --> 01:30.000
- A thousand pardons,
sir Sea Tiger.
- 一千次赦免，
海虎先生。

01:30.068 --> 01:31.931
[squeals]
Oh.
[尖叫声]
哦。

01:32.000 --> 01:33.551
[laughs]
[笑]

01:33.620 --> 01:36.137
Yep.
[rhythmic yell]
是的。
[有节奏的喊叫]

01:36.206 --> 01:39.827
[grunts]
And the elephant says...
[咕哝]
大象说……

01:39.896 --> 01:42.724
- [moos]
- [laughs]
- [哞哞]
- [笑]

01:42.793 --> 01:45.448
Whee!
哎哟！

01:46.724 --> 01:48.482
The giraffe goes...
长颈鹿走了...

01:48.551 --> 01:49.620
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

01:49.689 --> 01:53.034
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:53.103 --> 01:55.068
And the baboon says...
狒狒说……

01:55.137 --> 01:56.517
- [quacks]
- [庸医]

01:56.586 --> 01:59.172
- [laughs]
- [笑]

01:59.241 --> 02:02.034
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

02:02.103 --> 02:04.448
And the zookeeper goes...
然后动物园管理员就走了……

02:04.517 --> 02:06.655
- [growls]
Again with this kid!
- [咆哮]
又和这孩子在一起了！

02:06.724 --> 02:09.896
How many times
do I have to tell you
多少次
我必须告诉你吗

02:09.965 --> 02:12.517
to stay out
of the animal enclosures?
留在外面
动物围栏？

02:12.586 --> 02:14.448
These are not pets!
这些不是宠物！

02:14.517 --> 02:16.517
These are wild animals,
这些都是野生动物，

02:16.586 --> 02:20.172
and you can get
seriously injured.
你可以得到
重伤。

02:20.241 --> 02:22.758
- These little cuties are
dangerous?
- 这些小可爱们是
危险吗？

02:22.827 --> 02:24.413
[laughs]
- [growls]
[笑]
- [咆哮]

02:24.482 --> 02:26.827
- Don't be silly.
- 别傻了。

02:26.896 --> 02:29.310
- Oh, that's it!
- 哦，就是这样！

02:29.379 --> 02:30.448
[grunts]
[device beeps]
[咕哝]
[设备蜂鸣声]

02:30.517 --> 02:32.655
- For me?
Thanks.
- 为我？
谢谢。

02:32.724 --> 02:36.172
- No, it's not a gift.
It's an ankle alarm.
- 不，这不是礼物。
这是脚踝警报器。

02:36.241 --> 02:37.931
And the next time
you try to sneak
而下一次
你试图偷偷摸摸

02:38.000 --> 02:41.620
into the animal enclosures,
it's gonna do this...
进入动物围栏，
它会做这个...

02:41.689 --> 02:43.655
[alarm blares]
- SpongeBob Alert.
[警报声]
- 海绵宝宝警报。

02:43.724 --> 02:46.206
SpongeBob Alert.
SpongeBob Alert.
海绵宝宝警报。
海绵宝宝警报。

02:46.275 --> 02:47.482
- Get it?
- Got it.
- 得到它？
- 知道了。

02:47.551 --> 02:49.241
- Good.
- [yells]
- 好的。
- [大喊]

02:49.310 --> 02:51.655
Whoa!
[grunts]
哇！
[咕哝]

02:52.793 --> 02:53.793
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:54.862 --> 02:56.758
[laughs]
[笑]

02:56.827 --> 02:59.517
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

02:59.586 --> 03:00.689
[hums]
[哼哼]

03:00.758 --> 03:03.758
- [grunts]
- [squeaks]
- [咕哝]
- [吱吱声]

03:03.827 --> 03:05.344
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

03:05.413 --> 03:08.103
- [hums]
Huh?
- [哼哼]
啊？

03:08.172 --> 03:09.931
Oh, no you don't!
哦，不，你不！

03:10.000 --> 03:12.172
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:12.241 --> 03:13.517
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

03:13.586 --> 03:17.517
- [groans]
[all exclaiming]
- [呻吟]
[所有人惊呼]

03:17.586 --> 03:19.034
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:19.103 --> 03:20.827
[all shout]
[大家喊]

03:22.379 --> 03:23.758
- [quacks]
- [庸医]

03:25.586 --> 03:26.724
- That's it!
- [whimpering]
- 就是这样！
- [呜咽]

03:26.793 --> 03:29.655
- You are banned from the zoo!
- 你被禁止进入动物园！

03:29.724 --> 03:31.000
Get out!
出去！

03:31.068 --> 03:33.931
Out, I say!
[wheezes]
出去，我说！
[喘息声]

03:34.000 --> 03:35.379
- Yes, sir.
I'll go.
- 是的，先生。
我去吧。

03:35.448 --> 03:37.000
[squeaks, whimpers]
[吱吱声，呜咽声]

03:37.068 --> 03:38.241
- Hold it!
- 坚持住！

03:38.310 --> 03:40.275
If he goes, I go.
如果他走，我就走。

03:40.344 --> 03:42.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:42.482 --> 03:45.551
And you can keep
your dumb old peanuts.
并且你可以保留
你这些愚蠢的老花生。

03:45.620 --> 03:47.931
[huffs]
Come on, SpongeBob.
[怒气]
来吧，海绵宝宝。

03:48.000 --> 03:50.310
- And stay out!
- 留在外面！

03:50.379 --> 03:52.310
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

03:52.379 --> 03:56.965
- Oh, that's it now.
Let it out.
- 哦，现在就是这样了。
把它放出来。

03:57.034 --> 03:59.758
- I--I just wanna
pet the critters.
- 我--我只是想要
抚摸小动物。

03:59.827 --> 04:04.034
Does that make me an animal?
[sobs]
这会让我成为动物吗？
[抽泣]

04:04.103 --> 04:06.724
- That mean ol' zookeeper.
- 那是指老动物园管理员。

04:06.793 --> 04:10.862
He looks like a monkey
and he smells like one too.
他看起来像一只猴子
他闻起来也像一个。

04:10.931 --> 04:13.620
Ha, you should just make
your own zoo.
哈，你应该做
你自己的动物园。

04:13.689 --> 04:15.206
- [sniffles]
My own zoo.
- [抽鼻子]
我自己的动物园。

04:15.275 --> 04:18.586
That's a laugh.
[sniffles]
那是笑声。
[抽鼻子]

04:18.655 --> 04:19.620
Ooh.
哦。

04:20.724 --> 04:21.793
Ooh.
哦。

04:21.862 --> 04:23.862
Are you thinking
what I'm thinking?
你在想吗
我在想什么？

04:23.931 --> 04:25.241
- Ooh!
- [yelps]
- 哦！
- [尖叫声]

04:25.310 --> 04:27.000
both: Bubble zoo!
两者：泡泡动物园！

04:28.724 --> 04:31.034
- [inhales deeply, exhales]
- [深吸气，呼气]

04:31.103 --> 04:33.172
- Ooh!
- Voilà!
- 哦！
- 瞧！

04:33.241 --> 04:35.275
Our first zoo animals.
我们的第一个动物园动物。

04:35.344 --> 04:37.172
- [laughs]
Ooh, ooh!
- [笑]
哦哦哦！

04:37.241 --> 04:38.379
I get to name 'em!
我要给他们起名字！

04:38.448 --> 04:40.793
Um, your name is Saucepan.
- Ooh.
嗯，你的名字是锅。
- 哦。

04:40.862 --> 04:44.551
- Your name is Concrete,
and you're Debbie.
- 你的名字是混凝土，
你是黛比。

04:44.620 --> 04:48.827
- [groans]
- Oh, I forgot they're bubbles!
- [呻吟]
- 哦，我忘了它们是泡泡！

04:48.896 --> 04:51.068
[sobs]
[抽泣]

04:51.137 --> 04:52.310
[mischievous music]
[恶作剧的音乐]

04:52.379 --> 04:55.551
- Don't be a dope,
try extra strength soap.
- 别做个傻瓜
尝试使用强力肥皂。

04:57.103 --> 04:59.379
[inhaling deeply]
[深吸一口气]

04:59.448 --> 05:00.862
[exhaling]
[呼气]

05:00.931 --> 05:02.103
[bubble penguin quacks]
- Oh.
[泡泡企鹅嘎嘎叫]
- 哦。

05:02.172 --> 05:05.379
[grunting]
[bubble penguin squeaking]
[咕噜声]
[泡泡企鹅的吱吱声]

05:05.448 --> 05:07.103
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:07.172 --> 05:09.172
It worked!
It works!
成功了！
有用！

05:09.241 --> 05:10.482
- It works!
It works!
- 有用！
有用！

05:10.551 --> 05:12.586
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:12.655 --> 05:14.379
[inhaling deeply]
[深吸一口气]

05:14.448 --> 05:15.862
[exhaling]
[呼气]

05:17.137 --> 05:20.413
Oh, look at 'em, Patrick,
so happy and healthy.
哦，看看他们，帕特里克，
如此快乐和健康。

05:20.482 --> 05:23.275
Oh, and look, Patrick,
bubble droppings.
哦，看，帕特里克，
泡沫粪便。

05:23.344 --> 05:26.000
- Oh.
Bubble droppings?
- 哦。
泡沫粪便？

05:26.068 --> 05:27.068
[laughs]
[笑]

05:27.137 --> 05:29.586
Ooh!
I'm popping poops!
哦！
我拉屎了！

05:29.655 --> 05:32.586
[laughs]
Huh?
[笑]
啊？

05:32.655 --> 05:35.379
Hey!
[bubble goat burps, bleats]
嘿！
[泡泡山羊打嗝、咩咩叫]

05:35.448 --> 05:38.551
But I was gonna eat those.
但我本来想吃那些。

05:38.620 --> 05:40.413
- No more "buts."
- 不再有“但是”。

05:40.482 --> 05:43.241
We need more animals!
我们需要更多的动物！

05:43.310 --> 05:45.172
[inhales sharply, exhales]
[猛吸气，呼气]

05:45.241 --> 05:48.172
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

05:48.241 --> 05:51.172
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

05:51.241 --> 05:52.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:52.448 --> 05:54.758
Welcome to the Bubble Zoo,
欢迎来到泡泡动物园，

05:54.827 --> 05:57.413
where the price of admission
is a smile.
入场费在哪里
是一个微笑。

05:57.482 --> 05:58.586
- [squeaks]
- [吱吱声]

05:58.655 --> 06:00.379
- Just a second, you.
- 等一下，你。

06:00.448 --> 06:03.413
Ymm.
That's better.
嗯。
这样更好。

06:03.482 --> 06:04.793
- Hello, folks.
- 大家好。

06:04.862 --> 06:08.206
Please leave all
your sharp objects at the gate.
请全部留下
门口的尖锐物品。

06:08.275 --> 06:10.689
Okay, Grandpa, spread 'em.
好吧，爷爷，传播它们。

06:10.758 --> 06:12.241
[glove snaps]
- [gulps]
[手套按扣]
- [吞咽]

06:12.310 --> 06:15.413
[old man grunting]
[老人咕哝]

06:15.482 --> 06:16.931
[gasps]
Rascal.
[喘气]
无赖。

06:18.724 --> 06:21.724
- Gather 'round, folks,
and meet the animals.
- 聚集在一起，伙计们，
并认识动物。

06:21.793 --> 06:26.000
These wild bubble-phants
"never forget" to have fun.
这些野生的泡泡幻影
“永远不要忘记”玩得开心。

06:26.068 --> 06:27.448
[laughs]
[bubble-phant trumpeting]
[笑]
[泡泡幻影的喇叭声]

06:27.517 --> 06:29.103
Ah!
啊!

06:30.206 --> 06:32.413
These bubble-raffes are
necking,
这些气泡拉夫是
颈缩，

06:32.482 --> 06:34.206
and they have the necks for it.
他们有这个能力。

06:34.275 --> 06:35.620
[laughs]
[笑]

06:37.379 --> 06:38.413
[stopwatch beeping]
Ooh!
[秒表鸣响]
哦！

06:38.482 --> 06:39.965
Time to feed the sea monsters.
是时候喂海怪了。

06:41.241 --> 06:44.965
Oh, ally-zoop.[laughs]
哦，盟友动物园。[笑]

06:45.034 --> 06:46.241
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:46.310 --> 06:48.724
[inhales sharply, exhales]
[bubble chirping]
[猛吸气，呼气]
[泡泡叽叽喳喳]

06:48.793 --> 06:50.827
Come and get it!
[bubble fish chomps]
快过来取！
【泡泡鱼咬碎】

06:50.896 --> 06:54.275
- [chomps]
- [moans]
- [咀嚼]
- [呻吟]

06:54.344 --> 06:55.517
[bubble monster chomps]
[泡泡怪物咀嚼]

06:55.586 --> 06:56.724
[water splashes]
[水花四溅]

06:56.793 --> 06:58.827
[bubble monster chuckles]
[泡泡怪物咯咯笑]

06:58.896 --> 07:00.137
- Hi.
- 你好。

07:00.206 --> 07:02.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:03.000 --> 07:04.206
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

07:04.275 --> 07:07.620
[cheering]
[欢呼]

07:07.689 --> 07:09.034
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

07:09.103 --> 07:12.931
- [yawning]
[bones cracking]
- [打哈欠]
[骨头碎裂]

07:13.000 --> 07:15.448
Ooh.
♪ Up from my nap ♪
哦。
♪ 从午睡中醒来 ♪

07:15.517 --> 07:16.827
♪ Ya-ta-ta-ta ♪
♪ 呀呀呀呀 ♪

07:16.896 --> 07:18.586
♪ Getting my garden pants ♪
♪ 穿上我的花园裤 ♪

07:18.655 --> 07:20.068
♪ Ya-ta-ta-ta ♪
♪ 呀呀呀呀 ♪

07:20.137 --> 07:23.379
♪ Going out the door,
ya-ta-ta-ta ♪
♪ 走出家门，
呀呀呀呀♪

07:23.448 --> 07:24.758
♪ Walking on the tongue ♪
♪ 用舌头行走 ♪

07:24.827 --> 07:26.241
♪ Ya-ta-ta-ta ♪
♪ 呀呀呀呀 ♪

07:26.310 --> 07:27.965
♪ That's a lot of teeth ♪
♪ 牙齿很多 ♪

07:28.034 --> 07:30.172
Ya-ta-ta--ah!
呀呀呀呀啊！

07:30.241 --> 07:32.655
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

07:32.724 --> 07:34.655
[grunts]
- Hey, Squidward.
[咕哝]
- 嘿，章鱼哥。

07:34.724 --> 07:36.689
I see you're playing
with the sea monsters.
我看你在玩
与海怪。

07:36.758 --> 07:38.793
Isn't my bubble zoo fun?
我的泡泡动物园好玩吗？

07:38.862 --> 07:41.379
- Get me out of here,
you moron!
- 带我离开这里
你这个白痴！

07:41.448 --> 07:42.413
- Okay.
- 好的。

07:42.482 --> 07:44.172
Oh, Maggie.
哦，玛吉。

07:44.241 --> 07:46.724
Tickle, tickle,
let's put Squidward down.
痒痒，痒痒，
让我们把章鱼哥放下吧。

07:46.793 --> 07:49.517
[bubble monster grunting]
[泡泡怪物的咕噜声]

07:49.586 --> 07:51.344
Wow!
Aww.
哇！
哇。

07:51.413 --> 07:54.517
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:54.586 --> 07:56.620
[yelps]
Blech.
[尖叫声]
布莱赫。

07:56.689 --> 07:59.551
- And Squidward is reborn.
- 章鱼哥重生了。

07:59.620 --> 08:01.172
[all cheer]
- [groans]
[大家欢呼]
- [呻吟]

08:01.241 --> 08:05.206
Now wait just a darn second.
Uh--
现在等一下。
呃——

08:05.275 --> 08:06.344
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:06.413 --> 08:11.206
[yelling]
[大喊]

08:12.689 --> 08:13.965
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

08:14.034 --> 08:16.586
[bubble rhino huffs]
[Squidward squeals]
[泡泡犀牛怒气冲冲]
[章鱼哥尖叫]

08:16.655 --> 08:18.517
both: Look out, Squidward!
两人：小心，章鱼哥！

08:18.586 --> 08:20.448
[bubble rhino growls]
[泡泡犀牛咆哮]

08:20.517 --> 08:23.103
[Squidward whimpering]
[章鱼哥的呜咽声]

08:25.241 --> 08:27.103
- Run for your lives!
[all clamoring]
- 为你的生命而奔跑！
[全都吵闹]

08:27.172 --> 08:30.551
- Squidward,
don't forget to bring him back!
- 章鱼哥，
别忘了把他带回来！

08:30.620 --> 08:32.482
[bubble animals roar]
[泡泡动物咆哮]

08:32.551 --> 08:33.827
Nice, bubble beasts.
不错，泡泡兽。

08:33.896 --> 08:35.862
Uh, let's make you
some more enclosures, huh?
呃，让我们让你
还有一些外壳，是吗？

08:35.931 --> 08:40.172
[bubble animals roaring]
[泡泡动物咆哮]

08:40.241 --> 08:43.655
- Would now be a good time
to talk about my hours?
- 现在是个好时机
谈谈我的工作时间？

08:43.724 --> 08:46.068
- Stop those animals, Patrick.
- 阻止那些动物，帕特里克。

08:46.137 --> 08:47.379
Go!
去！

08:47.448 --> 08:49.551
- Huh?
Oh!
- 啊？
哦！

08:49.620 --> 08:51.241
[bubble animals roaring]
[泡泡动物咆哮]

08:51.310 --> 08:52.275
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:52.344 --> 08:55.275
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

08:55.344 --> 08:56.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:56.793 --> 08:59.413
[grunts softly]
Stop ani-mules!
[轻声咕哝]
别再用骡子了！

08:59.482 --> 09:00.758
Stop!
Stop!
停止！
停止！

09:00.827 --> 09:02.275
Stop!
Huh?
停止！
啊？

09:02.344 --> 09:03.310
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

09:03.379 --> 09:04.827
[yelling]
[大喊]

09:06.034 --> 09:08.413
But seriously, SpongeBob,
Thursdays are out.
但说真的，海绵宝宝，
周四已经出去了。

09:09.827 --> 09:12.482
[bubble animals roaring]
[泡泡动物咆哮]

09:12.551 --> 09:15.172
[perilous music]
[危险的音乐]

09:15.241 --> 09:17.655
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

09:17.724 --> 09:19.724
[bubble animals clamoring]
[泡泡动物叫嚣]

09:19.793 --> 09:21.862
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:21.931 --> 09:24.827
Take me customers,
but don't hurt me money!
带我去顾客，
但不要伤害我的钱！

09:24.896 --> 09:26.379
[till beeping]
[直到发出嘟嘟声]

09:26.448 --> 09:28.206
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:28.275 --> 09:31.241
Ahh!
啊！

09:31.310 --> 09:33.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:33.655 --> 09:37.310
[bubble penguins buzzing]
[泡泡企鹅嗡嗡声]

09:37.379 --> 09:42.275
- For hate's sake!
I spit my last breath at thee!
- 为了仇恨！
我向你吐出最后一口气！

09:42.344 --> 09:43.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:43.862 --> 09:45.310
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

09:45.379 --> 09:46.689
Ahh!
啊！

09:46.758 --> 09:49.068
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:49.137 --> 09:51.965
- Don't be so dramatic.
They're cute.
- 别这么戏剧化。
他们很可爱。

09:52.034 --> 09:53.310
Wait!
Wait!
等待！
等待！

09:53.379 --> 09:56.310
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

09:56.379 --> 09:58.413
[bubble penguins buzzing]
[泡泡企鹅嗡嗡声]

09:58.482 --> 10:00.034
[bubble animals roaring]
[泡泡动物咆哮]

10:00.103 --> 10:01.448
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

10:01.517 --> 10:05.620
- SpongeBob, why are
the animals making scary faces?
- 海绵宝宝，为什么
动物们做着可怕的鬼脸？

10:05.689 --> 10:07.413
- They've gone wild, Patrick!
- 他们太疯狂了，帕特里克！

10:07.482 --> 10:08.689
Wild!
荒野！

10:08.758 --> 10:11.896
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

10:13.034 --> 10:16.965
- [rhythmic yelling]
- [有节奏的喊叫]

10:18.689 --> 10:20.241
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:20.310 --> 10:22.758
Hey!
This ain't no furlough.
嘿！
这不是休假。

10:22.827 --> 10:25.931
Get back in your enclosures
right now!
回到你的围栏里
现在！

10:26.000 --> 10:28.965
[animals roar]
[SpongeBob yells rhythmically]
[动物咆哮]
[海绵宝宝有节奏地喊叫]

10:30.896 --> 10:34.344
Or whenever, you know.
I'm flexible.
或者无论什么时候，你知道。
我很灵活。

10:34.413 --> 10:37.310
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

10:37.379 --> 10:38.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:38.413 --> 10:40.034
- [rhythmic yelling]
- [有节奏的喊叫]

10:40.103 --> 10:42.551
- Look, SpongeBob,
it's the zoo animals!
- 看，海绵宝宝，
这是动物园里的动物！

10:42.620 --> 10:45.310
- They must have heard
my uvula.
-他们一定听说过
我的小舌。

10:45.379 --> 10:49.172
[all growling]
[全都咆哮]

10:49.241 --> 10:52.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:52.482 --> 10:55.413
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

10:55.482 --> 10:57.862
[bubble animals whimpering]
[泡泡动物呜咽]

10:59.551 --> 11:01.551
- You guys saved our lives!
- 你们救了我们的命！

11:01.620 --> 11:03.448
- Thank you, ani-mules!
- 谢谢你，阿尼骡子！

11:03.517 --> 11:06.448
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

11:08.517 --> 11:10.827
- And thank you, SpongeBob,
- 谢谢你，海绵宝宝，

11:10.896 --> 11:12.965
for bringing all my animalsback.
把我所有的动物带回来。

11:13.034 --> 11:15.931
And I just love
the new animals too.
我就是喜欢
还有新动物。

11:16.000 --> 11:19.724
You are welcome
at the zoo any time.
不客气
任何时间都可以去动物园。

11:19.793 --> 11:22.827
I officially remove the ban.
我正式解除禁令。

11:23.931 --> 11:25.517
[chuckles]
There you go.
[笑声]
就这样吧。

11:25.586 --> 11:27.413
- I promise
you won't regret it,
- 我保证
你不会后悔的

11:27.482 --> 11:28.793
Mr. Zookeeper, sir.
动物园管理员先生，先生。

11:28.862 --> 11:31.655
[rhythmic yell]
[有节奏的喊叫]

11:31.724 --> 11:35.689
I'm free again!
Free!
我又自由了！
自由的！

11:35.758 --> 11:39.206
Good morning, Squidward.
- Good morning.
早上好，章鱼哥。
- 早上好。

11:40.206 --> 11:43.275
[sighs]
It's a living.
[叹气]
这是一种生活。

[叹气]
这是一种生活。